bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Reply Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
entity VoteReplyModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Reply Upvote
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /upvote (reply)
activate Router

Router -> ReplyController: 3. upVote(reply_id, req)
activate ReplyController

opt Token / Role Invalid
    ReplyController --> Router: 3.1 401 / 403 Error
    Router --> UI: 3.2 Show error
    UI --> User: 3.3 Error message
end

ReplyController -> ReplyService: 4. upVote(reply_id, payload)
activate ReplyService

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 5. checkLegitUser(payload)
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

alt User not valid
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 5.1.1. Error
    ReplyController --> Router: 5.1.2. Error response
    Router --> UI: 5.1.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 5.1.4. Error message
else User is banned
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 5.2.1 Error
    ReplyController --> Router: 5.2.2 Error response
    Router --> UI: 5.2.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 5.2.4 Error message
end

ref over User, MongoDB: 6. Subsequence - Vote reply 1

@enduml
